{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年41歲的2009年香港小姐「最上鏡小姐」袁嘉敏（Candy），日前在印尼峇里島度假時大解放，憑一套布料極少的貝殼造型比堅尼掀起全網熱話。近日袁嘉敏再度性感升級，於社交平台大曬全新火辣泳衣照，視覺震撼度爆燈！</p><figure><img alt=\"41歲袁嘉敏身穿一件造型獨特、布料極少的貝殼比堅尼泳衣。(ig截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189398993361178624419782.jpeg/1tGZ10r1sLdTI_fublhS_cYOBUDYr9PQxpsNqcabDak\"/><figcaption>41歲袁嘉敏身穿一件造型獨特、布料極少的貝殼比堅尼泳衣。(ig截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏新泳衣極火辣。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190685463892201472618425.jpeg/F0PelIEbzyrjdUlfleTyeskWFVKZQi67349OH9-PTh8\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏新泳衣極火辣。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure><p>火紅深V泳衣中門大開直落肚臍</p><p>在最新的 IG 限時動態中，袁嘉敏換上一件剪裁極度大膽的鮮紅色一件頭泳裝，於充滿度假風情的浴室鏡前自信自拍。該套泳衣採用極致深V設計，剪裁直接大開直落肚臍，令其招牌豐滿上圍呼之欲出，深長事業線更是一覽無遺。雖然已年過四十，但她體態緊緻、曲線玲瓏且零贅肉，舉手投足間盡顯嫵媚女人味，獲網民盛讚狀態大勇、凍齡有術。</p><figure><img alt=\"深V到肚臍。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190685461631340544487392.png/gElT1LB4mf57Q6OC79Pb9BUd6r0VJOnkS1MwDEtTMAw\"/><figcaption>深V到肚臍。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷性感身材。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190685458980409344721439.png/ZzSZGNreoqH9OMXrHmUM3NA7xcD0kXNPJqzHzSasx80\"/><figcaption>大騷性感身材。（IG@candy_kamanyuen）</figcaption></figure><p>魅力與吸金力依然不減</p><p>袁嘉敏在相片中寫道「Fourth morning in beautiful Bali」，透露自己正沉醉於峇里島假期的第四個早晨，心情相當不錯。此外，她亦不忘在動態中附上個人專屬會員制平台收費訂閱連結，吸引一眾粉絲付費解鎖更多私密獨家內容，大方展示本錢之餘亦順勢吸金。</p><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏被指臉大。(ig@candy_kamanyuen)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1149114267396476928052146.jpeg/SUaaUVKgUwHyeImby-dZiXdSV9shB8DfuIaXGriGlxo\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏被指臉大。(ig@candy_kamanyuen)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏戰衣極大膽中門大開到肚臍。(ig@candy_kamanyuen)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1149114060357242880203948.jpeg/QoCZU7joIVTZxVBaao6O0O3CSY6Blb8hr4MYYq-DGGI\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏戰衣極大膽中門大開到肚臍。(ig@candy_kamanyuen)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏貝殼比堅尼都包不住她身材。(ig截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189399202145374208839502.jpeg/LzJ0TJ1K7nlSUEopjppFOvlwPpooNVlouvmWL7r5li8\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏貝殼比堅尼都包不住她身材。(ig截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏在峇里島度假。(ig截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189399199746101248436281.jpeg/OZSvt4mVWRKvfBaGJI-Bk3mrcIxnYJXhrGcn7axnJ-0\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏在峇里島度假。(ig截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏在鏡前自拍，大曬火辣身材。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190366566269849600528097.png/sru6UfMCdqJHRBGf2RFzWBRGtex2TL0K1fkg-9X5IPs\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏在鏡前自拍，大曬火辣身材。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏不時於社交網大方送福利，每次曬照均引起熱話。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190366845232877568983160.png/Nt-lqAVG-kCoq86sFrzHYMt0Zn0TtTHlDGvCJAxrwiQ\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏不時於社交網大方送福利，每次曬照均引起熱話。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁嘉敏好性感。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132289579773202432480259.jpeg/3yR0Kglw60Se943MkZuRfkMyTG817k0klojLw5aIy8M\"/><figcaption>袁嘉敏好性感。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T15:22:54.326769+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":717,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T15:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T19:18:16.995857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:34.716545+00:00","content_hash":"312027695d9adf7bf17351b491aabf181b1fa9a8dd7379f5a481d3807afb82e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}